OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 7, wins national Lowry art
OL,4,Aprize
OL,5,
OL,6,FA seven-year-old girl has won a
OL,7,Fnational competition for her artwork
OL,8,Fwhich was inspired by LS Lowry.
OL,10,FMia, of Salford, was picked as the
OL,11,Fwinner from 600 entries to the 2026
OL,12,FCopley Prize, an annual art competition
OL,13,Frun by the Lowry theatre and gallery.
OL,15,FHer artwork, titled A Man Going To
OL,16,FWork, is now hanging in the Andrew Law
OL,17,FGalleries, alongside the famous
OL,18,Fpaintings by Lowry himself, and will
OL,19,Fremain on display for the next 12
OL,20,Fmonths.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
